  <item>
    <title>06.离开我谁还给你讲这些童年秘闻！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66e05e45bfd7110df4b43f02</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66e05e45bfd7110df4b43f02</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 10 Sep 2024 14:57:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;嗨～欢迎回到莫扎特无聊，这一期我们聊到了我们三人的童年趣事，你的童年我的童年好像都一样～00后的童年原来是这样的，欢迎来“对号入座”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="131">00:02:11</a> 狗狗很可爱，但不要再追我了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="253">00:04:13</a> 有些事，小时候威风凛凛，现在尬的想鼠</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="373">00:06:13</a>我小时候的辉煌时刻:国家领导看过我跳舞？！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="617">00:10:17</a> 我与自行车大战二百回！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="738">00:12:18</a>小野忠告：不要吃太多辣条！！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1100">00:18:20</a>幼儿园往事一二三则</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1222">00:20:22</a>幼儿园时我的恋姐癖</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1344">00:22:24</a>第一次过马路 我骄傲</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1466">00:24:26</a>小屁孩的烦恼:写情柬、接我放学，爷爷的忽略</span></p><p><span>一键三连！谢谢大家！</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmccy0U68rNg2JuDwMjM9RrKmM6v.JPG"></figure><p><span>七七</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqd6Fmp7acqOhyJICzA-or83zXNO.JPG"></figure><p><span>小野</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu2z-Hiz6VzpMHLk-0SaB4Y7Scab.JPG"></figure><p><span>啵啵</span></p>]]></description>
