  </item>
  <item>
    <title>剧本杀特辑：震惊！原来爱一个人能演出来？剧本杀现场秒变瓜田</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6693be488fcadceb9038dde3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6693be488fcadceb9038dde3</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 14 Jul 2024 12:02:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>小众话题之剧本杀的情感本，听水龙头玩家讲述打本中的故事，原来哭也是一种娱乐放松的方式！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="24">00:24</a>欢迎新嘉宾加入！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="54">00:54</a> 大家都是什么类型的玩家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="104">01:44</a> 接触到剧本杀的契机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">02:10</a> 打得第一个本是？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="568">09:28</a> 三人一起玩剧本杀的经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="706">11:46</a> 之前遇到的很扯的变格本</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="890">14:50</a> 对dm或npc的看法?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1215">20:15</a> 打本中的心酸事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1715">28:35</a> 情感本玩家的两种类型?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1835">30:35</a> 怎样选择情感本? (打本吃什么线)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2282">38:02</a> 给77推荐角色?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2577">42:57</a> 打情感本的责任?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a> 情感本中有趣的角色or设定?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3327">55:27</a> 77有没有对情感本产生兴趣?</span></p><span></span><p><span>常驻：七个黑眼圈 &nbsp;小野恩恩子（本期缺席） &nbsp;奶酪啵啵&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：四金同学</span></p>]]></description>
